  <body>
    <p>
      1. Write the central idea
    </p>
    <p>
      2. Save the map
    </p>
    <p>
      3. Select central node,
    </p>
    <p>
      &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;click on icon to add picture
    </p>
    <p>
      4. Delete menu links Add image..
    </p>
