      &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;with CTRL+K and delete field with link
    </p>
    <p>
      5. Delete node details with right click on mouse
    </p>
    <p>
      &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;on central node - Remove node details
    </p>
  </body>
</html></richcontent>
